integrated development this land is already surrounded by high impact infrastructure there are already three existing or planned electrical substations on the property along with a multitude of high voltage transmission lines furthermore we are immediately adjacent to the 900 acre metadata center campus from an in from an infrastructure perspective this land is already deeply integrated third service extension this property is the uniquely plug-and-play all required utilities are already sitting at the property line the infrastructure is ready and we will fund 100% of the costs that tie into these existing utilities including the reimbursement district ensuring zero financial burden to Cheyenne's taxpayers fourth health safety health safety and welfare this is where the community wins unlike other developments data centers generate virtually no daily traffic furthermore by annexing this property we will help solve a major local transportation issue by facilitating the expansion of Wallik and

